title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.unemployed) {
    Q.unemployed_2 = Q.unemployed.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.inflation) {
    Q.inflation_2 = Q.inflation.toFixed(1);
}
Q.economic_growth_2 = '0';
if (Q.economic_growth) {
    Q.economic_growth_2 = Q.economic_growth.toFixed(1);
}
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Resources available: [+ resources +]

<span style="color: #10186e">KMT</span> Leader: [+ kmt_leader +]

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

= Government

President of the <span style="color: #e0e058">Be</span>
<span style="color: #d1b24b">iy</span>
<span style="color: #2587b8">a</span>
<span style="color: #ffffff">n</span>
<span style="color: #000000">g</span> Government: [+ beiyang_leader +] ([+ beiyang_leader_party +])

Deputy Leader of the <span style="color: #e0e058">Be</span>
<span style="color: #d1b24b">iy</span>
<span style="color: #2587b8">a</span>
<span style="color: #ffffff">n</span>
<span style="color: #000000">g</span> Government: [+ deputy_beiyang_leader +] ([+ deputy_beiyang_leader_party +])

Budget: [+ budget +]

= Economics

Inflation: [+ inflation_2 +]%

Unemployment: [+ unemployed_2 +]%

Economic growth: [+ economic_growth_2 +]%



# = Public Opinion

@politics

